  "title": "习近平考察山丹培黎学校和山丹马场",
  "date": "2019-08-21 07:19:32",
  "author": "新华社",
  "editor": "(责编：王珂园                     )",
  "article": "<div class=\"d2txt_con clearfix\">\n<p></p><p style=\"text-indent: 2em;\">\n正在甘肃省考察的习近平总书记20日下午抵达张掖市山丹县，前往山丹培黎学校和山丹马场考察调研，了解当地职业教育培训和祁连山生态环境修复保护等情况。（文字记者：张晓松、朱基钗 摄影记者：鞠鹏、谢环驰）</p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center\">\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"http://www.people.com.cn/mediafile/pic/20190821/29/6269976905823272797.jpg\"/></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center\">\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"http://www.people.com.cn/mediafile/pic/20190821/15/8896002946557858851.jpg\"/></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center\">\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"http://www.people.com.cn/mediafile/pic/20190821/71/15088838887275268491.jpg\"/></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center\">\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"http://www.people.com.cn/mediafile/pic/20190821/70/17973679330746112062.jpg\"/></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center\">\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"http://www.people.com.cn/mediafile/pic/20190821/83/13356041251922282359.jpg\"/></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center\">\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"http://www.people.com.cn/mediafile/pic/20190821/95/9195241396704733607.jpg\"/></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center\">\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"http://www.people.com.cn/mediafile/pic/20190821/94/2781865790660582186.jpg\"/></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center\">\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"http://www.people.com.cn/mediafile/pic/20190821/31/5364367871999287235.jpg\"/></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center\">\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"http://www.people.com.cn/mediafile/pic/20190821/46/3064452842037265138.jpg\"/></p>\n</div>",
  "text": [
    "正在甘肃省考察的习近平总书记20日下午抵达张掖市山丹县，前往山丹培黎学校和山丹马场考察调研，了解当地职业教育培训和祁连山生态环境修复保护等情况。（文字记者：张晓松、朱基钗 摄影记者：鞠鹏、谢环驰）"
  ]
}
